 <h3><u>Marhaba Shere Ali</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>MARHABA SHERE ALI 4</p> 
  <p>RAN MEI JIS DAM ABU TALIB KA SIPAHI AAYA 2<br> SHOR UTTHA ASADE SHERE ILAAHI AAYA<br> AHLE BAATIL KE LIYE BANKE TABAHI AAYA<br> SUNKE YEH FAUJE SITAMGAR ME HAI HULCHUL SI MACHI</p> 
  <p>DADA WO DEEN THI JAHA AAYE DUHAAI LEKAR 2<br> BAAP JO SOYE TOH FIR UTTHE KHUDAAI LEKAR<br> AUR YEH PALTEGA CHULLU ME TARAAYI LEKAR<br> AAJ AAYEGI HAR EK SIMT SE AAWAAZ YAHI</p> 
  <p>KHUSHK SEHRAAO K DAAMAN ME LAHOO AT JAATE 2<br> LAASH KE DHER SE MAIDANE WIGA PAT JAATE<br> AATE JIBREEL TO JIBREEL K PAR KAT JAATE</p> 
  <p>SABR KO ZABT KE EHSAAS NE SONE NA DIYA 2<br> NEHAR BECHAIN RAHI PYAAS NE SONE NA DIYA<br> HAAKIME SHAAM KO ABBAS NE SONE NA DIYA<br> PAHRADAARO KI LABE NEHAR KAMAR TOOT GAYI</p> 
  <p>SIDIYA JISNE BHI ROZE KI UTAR KAR DEKHA 2<br> USNE NAAYAAB FAZILAT KAA SAMANDAR DEKHA<br> DEKHNE WALO KI NAZRO NE YEH MANZAR DEKHA<br> AAJ BHI LIPTI HUI HAI TERE KADMO SE NADI</p> 
